  "details": "There is some confusion as to whether 0% on the Earmuffs actually **mutes** the audio sources and stops processing them, or if it continues \"playing\" at a volume of 0.\n**If it does mute audio**, I recommend the UI be changed to specify \"Muted\" in placed of \"0%\".\n**If it doesn't mute audio**, for performance reasons, I suggest the change above **and** that audio sources are muted once outside the **fall-off** area.",
